## Why This Audit Is a Strong Reference

This audit is a strong public proof point for Softstack’s work in:

- DeFi smart contract audits
- farming and staking security reviews
- reward logic validation
- production-facing Web3 infrastructure
- high-visibility crypto ecosystem security

According to Softstack’s public case study, the review focused on code integrity, vulnerability mitigation, access control, gas efficiency, and reward calculation accuracy. The case study also states that no critical or high-risk vulnerabilities were found, while several minor improvements were identified and addressed or acknowledged. :contentReference[oaicite:7]{index=7}

## Summary

This folder highlights Softstack’s public smart contract audit work for **[Bitcoin.com](https://www.bitcoin.com/)** and its **[VERSE ecosystem](https://verse.bitcoin.com/)**.

It is a strong public reference for Softstack’s ability to secure user-facing DeFi infrastructure where staking logic, reward distribution, and contract reliability are central to platform trust.

For additional context on the engagement, see the **[Softstack Bitcoin.com case study](https://softstack.io/case-study/securing-bitcoin-coms-farming-contracts/)**.
